4
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,640
Ning'an County isn't far from here.

5
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,840
When will Jiaojiao come back?

6
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,480
She should be back soon.

7
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,840
Chief Su,

8
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:01,760
thank you for your care.

9
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,760
I'll take my leave now.

10
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,239
See you.

11
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:08,639
You'd better listen to your parents

12
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,599
and study hard.

13
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,800
Chief Escort Su

14
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:14,039
Do you want to control me like my father?

15
00:02:14,879 --> 00:02:16,199
You're still in the play.

16
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,039
See you.

17
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:20,439
For escorts, come to Su's Agency.

18
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,240
Su's Escort Agency

19
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,439
The escort lives with the escort.

20
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,599
Well.

21
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,560
Cool.

22
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:29,439
Goodbye.

23
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,639
Boss, just let them go like this?

24
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:36,439
Yeah.

25
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:38,479
I think he's much better than those people.

26
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,960
How can I put a knife on his neck

27
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,840
and take him home?

28
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,520
Hehe, you can do it.

29
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,840
Didn't you just do it?

30
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,000
Do you want to be beaten?

31
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,280
We are escorts,

32
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,159
not bandits.

33
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,599
Let's go back to the escort agency.

34
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:50,960
Oh, right.

35
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,759
Gong Xi,

36
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,280
Remind me to get my money back from Matchmaker Pavilion.

37
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,759
Oh.

38
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,560
Okay.

39
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:05,199
Hello, sir.

40
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,080
Oh,

41
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,639
you're here.

42
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,680
Please come in.

43
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,439
Looks like

44
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:13,800
I'm in for tonight's Nebula Assembly.

45
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,439
You're so talented.

46
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,759
You deserve it.

47
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,919
Someone will take you to your seat later.

48
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,039
Thank you.

49
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,479
Sir,

50
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:27,960
bring all your signature dishes

51
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,080
and drinks.

52
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:29,759
Okay.

53
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:30,560
Please wait a moment.

54
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,039
OK.

55
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:40,000
You should drink the wine quickly.

56
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,599
When the Nebula Assembly starts later,

57
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:46,000
only the participants can stay in Huayue Tower.

58
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,639
Who has the final say

59
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,759
in the circle of literati in Yunjing?

60
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,199
Who?

61
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,560
The boss of Huayue Tower,

62
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,000
Zhang Xiyun.

63
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:58,479
Isn't she the boss of Cloud Bookstore?

64
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:02,039
In the entire Yunjing and even the Yun State,

65
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:05,159
as long as it's related to poetry and books,

66
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,560
it basically all belongs to her.

67
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:10,639
This woman is actually so impressive.

68
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:13,400
You must be from out of town, right?

69
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:17,079
She also organized the Nebula Assembly.

70
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:21,959
As long as you win the Nebula Assembly,

71
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,079
you can

72
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:27,240
become famous in the literary circle of the Yun State.

73
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,279
You are so insightful.

74
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:33,439
What exactly is the Nebula Assembly about?

75
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:33,879
Yicheng,

76
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,439
are you full?

77
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,120
How would I know?

78
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,720
No.

79
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,720
Check, please.

80
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,920
Eighty taels.

81
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,680
Are you kidding me?

82
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:52,199
This wine is the best in Yunjing City,

83
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,759
fifty taels a pot.

84
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:57,199
These dishes are also the best in Huayue Tower.

85
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,759
Do you two

86
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,040
do you want to run away from the bill?

87
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:06,759
It's okay.

88
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:07,600
I'll drink first.

89
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,439
Yicheng,

90
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,199
pay the bill.

91
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:23,759
Do you want to stay in the inn tonight?

92
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,079
Uh,

93
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,199
we have something to do later.

94
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,439
We'll choose a room when we come back.

95
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,040
Let's go.

96
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:38,279
You should come back as soon as possible.

97
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,959
Don't miss the Nebula Assembly.

98
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,240
Take care.

99
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,160
Wait.

100
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,800
Pack these up for me.

101
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,480
You can go now.

102
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,600
I won't marry you.

103
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,480
My Lord,

104
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,600
he's been waiting for you so long.

105
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,519
You just drove him away.

106
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:12,920
You're so rude.

107
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,120
I'm a bodyguard.

108
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,040
I don't need to be polite.

109
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,120
If you don't like it, just leave.

110
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,399
Dad.

111
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,399
Look at how she talks.

112
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,000
I don't want a husband like this.

113
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,839
Su Yuejiao.

114
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:31,160
I've inquired at the Matchmaker Pavilion.

115
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,399
Dabao meets

116
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,199
all your requirements.

117
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,600
If you want to stay at the escort agency,

118
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:42,920
Who else can marry into the Su family

119
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,720
in Yunjing City

120
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,360
except for Dabao?

121
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,079
If Dabao doesn't work out,

122
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,720
you won't be able to hold the seal.

123
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,199
You think Guo Yongshi is impolite.

124
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,360
Dabao should be polite, right?

125
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:55,279
Yeah, Dabao is very well-behaved.

126
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,600
He listens to me.

127
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,160
Hehe.

128
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,439
Can he escort goods?

129
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,720
He looks too weak.

130
00:07:04,279 --> 00:07:05,839
He can.

131
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,040
He?

132
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,920
Humph.

133
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,759
Come here.

134
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,120
What?

135
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:29,560
Ah.

136
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,319
Come on.

137
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,160
Come on.

138
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,199
Get away.

139
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,480
Sis,

140
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,680
She's been gone for six hours.

141
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,879
Young Master,

142
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,759
let's find a place to stay.

143
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:57,040
Fifty taels for a pot of wine.

144
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,399
Forget about lodging,

145
00:07:58,399 --> 00:07:59,680
I can't even afford

146
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,040
the second round with my savings.

147
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:04,120
Wait here for me.

148
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,600
Okay.

149
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,319
Again.

150
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,439
Enjoy yourself.

151
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,399
Ah.

152
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,399
Nebula Assembly is about to start.

153
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,600
Come back tomorrow.

154
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,920
I'm Cheng Qi from Ning'an County.

155
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,120
I'm here to attend the Nebula Assembly.

156
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:25,199
Do you have any proof?

157
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,920
Proof?

158
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,199
I don't have any.

159
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,519
But

160
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,720
if you ask Shopkeeper Li,

161
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,840
and everything will be clear.

162
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,440
He's busy.

163
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,919
You can wait over there.

164
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:43,559
Hahaha.

165
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,799
Isn't this the second-in-command?

166
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:45,639
Young Master Shen.

167
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:48,519
The Nebula Assembly has been given to you.

168
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:50,799
Your business is booming.

169
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,600
Thanks to all of you.

170
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,559
Please come in.

171
00:08:53,559 --> 00:08:53,960
This way.

172
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,360
Hey!

173
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,799
Why can he go in directly?

174
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:59,000
He doesn't have a pass either!

175
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,440
You bumpkin,

176
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:02,159
you don't even know me,

177
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:04,039
yet you dare to attend the Nebula Assembly?

178
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:05,360
Do you have a name on your face?

179
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,200
Do I need to know you to attend the assembly?

180
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:09,600
I won't argue with a lowlife like you.

181
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,039
This guy is here to stir up trouble.

182
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,879
Get him out of here.

183
00:09:12,879 --> 00:09:14,639
Don't tarnish the reputation of the Assembly.

184
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,159
Get out of here!

185
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:16,919
Or I'll deal with you.

186
00:09:16,919 --> 00:09:17,799
I'm not leaving.

187
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:19,080
Go ahead and report me.

188
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,440
I'll deal with someone like you.

189
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,200
Do I need to report it?

190
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:21,720
Stop!

191
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,559
Are you here to guard

192
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,679
or to make trouble?

193
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,559
Miss.

194
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:27,759
Miss Ying,

195
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,080
this guy said he came to attend the convention,

196
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:32,279
but it's already past the time for entry verification,

197
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,519
and he doesn't have a pass.

198
00:09:33,639 --> 00:09:34,799
I think he's just a rascal.

199
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,120
Young Master Cheng,

200
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,279
don't be late next time.

201
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:39,039
Ah.

202
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:46,039
Young Master Cheng,

203
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:46,799
Please.

204
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,000
Oh, no.

205
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:57,600
Oh, my.

206
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,600
What should I do?

207
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,639
You can't beat me.

208
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,720
You can't beat me, right?

209
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,120
I told you.

210
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,279
You two are a good match.

211
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:15,679
Jiaojiao.

212
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,840
You should control your temper.

213
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,559
You can't

214
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:21,000
judge a book by its cover.

215
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,639
Pick a day

216
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:24,159
and get married.

217
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:26,120
Don't stop.

218
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,799
I'm not done yet.

219
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:58,559
Hehe, sister.

220
00:10:58,559 --> 00:10:59,360
I won.

221
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,159
Can you marry me?

222
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,200
In that case,

223
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:05,559
why don't you set the date?

224
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:07,799
Five days later is a good day.

225
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:08,919
How about it?

226
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,879
Great!

227
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:13,000
Marry her!

228
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:14,879
Great!

229
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:15,879
Marry her! Marry her!

230
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:17,919
I think it's a good idea.

231
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:18,519
No.

232
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,960
Why not?

233
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:20,799
Because...

234
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:23,919
Because...

235
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:26,240
Su Yuejiao, tell me.

236
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,720
Why not?

237
00:11:28,639 --> 00:11:29,440
I...

238
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:36,519
Because the boss has already...

239
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:38,039
Because the boss has already

240
00:11:38,039 --> 00:11:39,480
got married.

241
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,559
What?

242
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,240
Hey,

243
00:12:07,639 --> 00:12:09,320
do you know the guy

244
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,480
the guy sitting in the back?

245
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:12,360
Never seen him before.

246
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:15,000
Probably some poor scholar from nowhere.

247
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,799
Welcome to the Nebula Assembly.

248
00:12:35,519 --> 00:12:37,200
Tonight is the preliminary round of the assembly.

249
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,320
I believe everyone is also aware

250
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,639
that the written exam content today

251
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:44,320
is actually very simple for everyone.

252
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:45,600
How come it's her?

253
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,600
All the selected works for today...

254
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,879
Has the Matchmaker Pavilion closed down?

255
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:50,159
have been compiled by the Cloud Bookstore

256
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,039
and placed on your tables.

257
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,840
You will perform your works

258
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,000
in order according to your seating.

259
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,080
If needed,

260
00:12:58,159 --> 00:13:01,879
the musicians from the Huayue Tower will provide accompaniment.

261
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:15,519
I wonder how Miss Su is doing now.

262
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:19,519
She's coming out now.

263
00:13:19,519 --> 00:13:20,720
Explain to me clearly.

264
00:13:20,879 --> 00:13:22,240
Who did you marry?

265
00:13:22,279 --> 00:13:23,039
Who is he?

266
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,200
How did you meet?

267
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:25,000
Did he

268
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:26,639
take advantage of you?

269
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:27,840
Brother,

270
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,799
do you want me to marry Zhen Dabao?

271
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:30,759
Of course not.

272
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:31,720
It's absolutely impossible.

273
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,320
So I have to find him right now.

274
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:36,240
Rather than marrying the man Su Lishi found,

275
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,120
I'd rather marry him.

276
00:13:59,159 --> 00:13:59,879
Jiaojiao,

277
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:01,120
let's go back.

278
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,519
If Tang Xin finds out

279
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:03,720
I climbed over the wall...

280
00:14:04,559 --> 00:14:05,240
Right.

281
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,799
But where is

282
00:14:06,799 --> 00:14:07,759
Tang Xin?

283
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:10,200
Why are you so hesitant?

284
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:11,840
Chief Su,

285
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,399
there's a door.

286
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,480
Why did you climb over the wall?

287
00:14:18,639 --> 00:14:19,360
Ah,

288
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:22,000
I'm relieved to see you.

289
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:25,159
Have you seen Tang Xin?

290
00:14:27,559 --> 00:14:28,279
Tang Xin?

291
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:29,320
Why are you looking for her?

292
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:31,440
Well,

293
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,759
she knows I've been looking for a son-in-law.

294
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,799
She said there are many handsome

295
00:14:36,159 --> 00:14:38,279
and talented young men at the Nebula Assembly.

296
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,200
So she asked me to come and have a try.

297
00:14:40,759 --> 00:14:42,080
The Nebula Assembly

298
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:45,399
is a place for us to pick talents,

299
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,879
not for you to find a husband.

300
00:14:49,559 --> 00:14:50,919
You're right.

301
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:55,840
But Miss Tang Xin asked me

302
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,240
to let you in.

303
00:14:58,399 --> 00:15:00,679
You're really good friends.

304
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:01,960
Thank you.

305
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:04,440
If you need any help, just tell me.

306
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,159
I'll give you a discount.

307
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,159
No need to wait.

308
00:15:06,399 --> 00:15:07,559
I have a task for you now.

309
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,000
Welcome back from Ning'an!

310
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,720
The show just started.

311
00:15:32,559 --> 00:15:34,120
Good thing I got this for you.

312
00:15:34,879 --> 00:15:35,600
Why do I need this?

313
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,720
I can't play music.

314
00:15:36,879 --> 00:15:39,360
Just fake it till you make it.

315
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,879
Let me tell you,

316
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,840
there are plenty of handsome guys here.

317
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:44,799
Put on a show,

318
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:45,799
and you can stay longer.

319
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:51,600
Have you seen that guy we met before?

320
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,279
You finally got it!

321
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:57,120
How did you know he's here?

322
00:15:57,799 --> 00:15:58,519
It's a long story.

323
00:15:58,519 --> 00:15:59,519
To make it short,

324
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,240
I...

325
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,840
I accidentally married him.

326
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:06,679
Now I need his help.

327
00:16:06,759 --> 00:16:07,720
You're married?

328
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,960
Keep your voice down!

329
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:15,480
What a lucky girl!

330
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,559
There he is.

331
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,600
Tell me what happened.

332
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:22,879
I have to take him back now,

333
00:16:22,879 --> 00:16:25,600
or Su Lishi will force me to get married.

334
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,639
When will the Nebula Assembly end?

335
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,600
OK.

336
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,519
My dear.

337
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:34,000
One day without seeing you

338
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:34,840
is like a year.

339
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,679
Stop laughing.

340
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:38,559
Play the music.

341
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,879
I'll tell you later.

342
00:16:40,759 --> 00:16:41,559
Hum.

343
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,919
I heard that you can't talk to other women

344
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:52,279
normally except for your sister.

345
00:16:52,799 --> 00:16:53,600
Is that true?

346
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:58,519
It's done.

347
00:17:01,879 --> 00:17:02,679
Chai.

348
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:03,799
Take it to the kitchen.

349
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:05,720
Take it to the kitchen.

350
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,839
You two

351
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,680
are both geniuses.

352
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,920
Please play a piece of Butterfly in Love with Flowers.

353
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:37,599
♪Spring rain embraces willows.♪

354
00:17:37,599 --> 00:17:38,680
Cliche.

355
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,960
♪Sipping wine,♪

356
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:43,680
♪only longing for beauty.♪

357
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,839
Slacking off here?

358
00:17:48,759 --> 00:17:50,519
I must teach him a lesson for my parents.

359
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,160
It's none of my business.

360
00:17:57,519 --> 00:18:00,680
♪Wine and flowers, flowers won't bloom.♪

361
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:05,519
♪Looking back, only the cold night moon.♪

362
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,319
Why are you laughing?

363
00:18:26,359 --> 00:18:27,240
Sir,

364
00:18:28,039 --> 00:18:30,119
hearing your tune,

365
00:18:30,119 --> 00:18:31,640
I thought of an old friend.

366
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,359
It's quite amusing.

367
00:18:34,359 --> 00:18:36,880
I thought you came for the Nebula Assembly,

368
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:39,599
but you're just here to listen to tunes.

369
00:18:40,599 --> 00:18:42,400
You've got it wrong.

370
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:44,759
Your lyrics and tune,

371
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,400
while simple, are elegant.

372
00:18:48,079 --> 00:18:50,599
I didn't mean to look down on them.

373
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:56,039
A nameless bumpkin like you,

374
00:18:56,039 --> 00:18:57,119
what do you know about elegance?

375
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,240
The Nebula Assembly

376
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:04,559
is great

377
00:19:04,839 --> 00:19:06,240
because it's inclusive.

378
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,680
As long as you have the passion

379
00:19:08,839 --> 00:19:10,039
and the words in your heart,

380
00:19:10,039 --> 00:19:13,720
even a village bumpkin can make a difference.

381
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,000
But,

382
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,799
with your talent,

383
00:19:18,359 --> 00:19:21,400
we can't even fathom it.

384
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:26,920
Hahaha.

385
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,880
What are they laughing at?

386
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:31,519
Your husband is saying this young master

387
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,680
is vulgar and unbearable.

388
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:33,519
Oh.

389
00:19:33,519 --> 00:19:34,319
Uh...

390
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:37,960
Thank you for bringing this interesting interlude.

391
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:39,240
Please return to your seats.

392
00:19:39,359 --> 00:19:40,400
The meeting continues.

393
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:42,839
Wait.

394
00:19:44,119 --> 00:19:44,960
What's your name?

395
00:19:45,039 --> 00:19:45,839
Tell me.

396
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:51,759
I'm Cheng Qi,

397
00:19:52,279 --> 00:19:53,319
from Ning'an.

398
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,319
Cheng Qi?

399
00:19:56,319 --> 00:19:58,119
I'd like to see

400
00:19:58,119 --> 00:19:59,880
what you can write.

401
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,200
Well,

402
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:05,079
Mr. Cheng...

403
00:20:22,279 --> 00:20:24,079
In just a few days,

404
00:20:24,319 --> 00:20:25,799
we can see a lifetime.

405
00:20:26,799 --> 00:20:29,000
Seemingly unaware of sorrow's taste,

406
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,599
I ask where sorrow stems from.

407
00:20:32,319 --> 00:20:34,559
All sorts of winds pass by the ear.

408
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,759
You call for a smile and it is achieved.

409
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:43,839
Yet I fear this reason is not sound.

410
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,720
What's the point of seeking fame and fortune?

411
00:20:53,119 --> 00:20:56,720
Clinging to appearances in Zen only leads to bondage.

412
00:20:57,039 --> 00:20:59,799
Originally, there is no distinction between you and me.

413
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:03,559
Detached from worldly affairs, far from the flow of dust.

414
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:08,640
If one must be drunk to find relief,

415
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,319
♪ But there's no wine in the cup. ♪

416
00:21:11,759 --> 00:21:14,000
♪ How can I get drunk? ♪

417
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:17,359
♪ Who can hear the voice of flowers and the moon? ♪

418
00:21:18,039 --> 00:21:19,279
♪ The wind is silent. ♪

419
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,359
♪ Spring is broken. ♪

420
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:26,440
♪ I wandered wildly in the deep alley. ♪

421
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,240
♪ Silks fluttering. ♪

422
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:31,200
♪ It's better to have red feathers falling from the sky. ♪

423
00:21:32,119 --> 00:21:33,440
♪ They are gently swaying. ♪

424
00:21:35,519 --> 00:21:37,960
♪ Red clouds falling. ♪

425
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:47,319
♪ Heroes' shadows fade, and people sigh. ♪

426
00:21:47,759 --> 00:21:49,400
♪Only love remains♪

427
00:21:51,279 --> 00:21:53,960
♪Between heaven and earth♪

428
00:21:54,839 --> 00:21:56,200
♪Only loss♪

429
00:21:57,039 --> 00:21:59,039
♪Is the most cherished♪

430
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:01,920
Bravo!

431
00:22:09,319 --> 00:22:10,359
What a racket!

432
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:14,519
He should be disqualified from the Nebula Assembly!

433
00:22:15,599 --> 00:22:17,119
Young Master, please behave yourself.

434
00:22:17,119 --> 00:22:18,559
How dare you tell me to behave myself?

435
00:22:18,599 --> 00:22:20,519
I'm just reciting from the booklet.

436
00:22:20,519 --> 00:22:22,079
How could he change it?

437
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:23,880
He should be disqualified.

438
00:22:27,759 --> 00:22:29,279
Please take him out.

439
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:31,680
Miss Zhang, it's him who broke the rules.

440
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:33,440
He didn't say the lines from the booklet.

441
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,880
Why should I be disqualified?

442
00:22:35,559 --> 00:22:37,200
Because the Nebula Assembly

443
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,279
is

444
00:22:38,279 --> 00:22:39,599
the rule.

445
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:48,720
Please.

446
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:53,720
Mr. Cheng.

447
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:55,680
Please.

448
00:22:59,519 --> 00:23:00,519
The competition continues.

449
00:23:04,559 --> 00:23:05,759
That's your boss?

450
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,640
Yes.

451
00:23:09,359 --> 00:23:11,039
She looks petite,

452
00:23:11,079 --> 00:23:12,119
but she has a strong aura.

453
00:23:13,079 --> 00:23:15,720
Of course, she owns countless businesses.

454
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,359
Most of these young masters

455
00:23:17,359 --> 00:23:19,200
are here for her.

456
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:24,240
Your husband is interesting.

457
00:23:25,799 --> 00:23:27,240
He's not afraid of the powerful,

458
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,279
and he's reasonable and polite.

459
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:31,240
I agree with this marriage.

460
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:36,839
But can a man like him

461
00:23:36,839 --> 00:23:38,519
be willing to marry into your family?

462
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:44,200
The contest is over.

463
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:46,920
The second round will be held at Huayue Tower.

464
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,880
The results will be posted

465
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:50,559
on the Public Opinion Column.

466
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,240
Mr. Cheng, you are so talented.

467
00:24:00,319 --> 00:24:01,119
I admire you.

468
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:03,039
Mr. Cheng, you are so outstanding.

469
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:03,480
You're too kind.

470
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:04,440
I'm willing to concede defeat.

471
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,279
You flatter me.

472
00:24:05,279 --> 00:24:06,440
He's a man of some importance,

473
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:09,400
as you're willing to defend him.

474
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,400
Mr. Cheng is a handsome man.

475
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,440
Even if he was unknown before,

476
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:13,279
he will rise rapidly in the world.

477
00:24:13,279 --> 00:24:13,599
I've heard a lot about you.

478
00:24:13,599 --> 00:24:14,799
Why don't we make friends?

479
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:21,200
You won't stay here tonight?

480
00:24:22,759 --> 00:24:24,680
I'll go to my friend's house.

481
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:25,640
Thank you, innkeeper.

482
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,799
My lady specifically instructed that

483
00:24:28,079 --> 00:24:29,079
if you come to Huayue Tower

484
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:31,160
before the second test,

485
00:24:31,319 --> 00:24:33,799
all your expenses will be covered.

486
00:24:34,799 --> 00:24:37,000
Please tell her

487
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:39,640
I appreciate her help.

488
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:40,519
This way.

489
00:24:44,119 --> 00:24:45,599
If you don't hurry,

490
00:24:45,599 --> 00:24:47,000
all the inns will be closed.

491
00:24:47,759 --> 00:24:49,079
Don't panic.

492
00:24:49,279 --> 00:24:51,160
I've found a place to stay.

493
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,440
Nebula Assembly paid the money.

494
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:53,279
No.

495
00:24:53,279 --> 00:24:54,079
But

496
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:55,359
we got a man.

497
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,279
A man?

498
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:02,200
Chief Escort Su,

499
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,720
your brother just left.

500
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:04,319
Oh.

501
00:25:04,319 --> 00:25:05,640
Next time you come here,

502
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,039
you can go through the front door.

503
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:09,079
Thank you, Shopkeeper Li.

504
00:25:13,799 --> 00:25:14,319
You...

505
00:25:15,079 --> 00:25:15,880
You tell me first.

506
00:25:20,359 --> 00:25:22,079
Can you come back to the escort agency with me?

507
00:25:23,799 --> 00:25:27,440
Didn't you say we should owe each other nothing?

508
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:29,480
Why do you need me so soon?

509
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:30,960
The situation is a bit complicated.

510
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,759
Besides, you still owe me a favor.

511
00:25:32,759 --> 00:25:35,039
I need it right now.

512
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:37,720
Then tell me

513
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,160
what I can do for you.

514
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,319
I need you

515
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:46,480
as my

516
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:49,000
husband,

517
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,319
come home with me.

518
00:25:51,319 --> 00:25:51,720
What?

519
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:58,119
Are you

520
00:25:58,519 --> 00:26:01,359
going to run away from home?

521
00:26:01,359 --> 00:26:02,200
Cut the crap.

522
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,160
Yes or no?

523
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:06,759
What if I say no?

524
00:26:07,559 --> 00:26:08,799
Well,

525
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:11,279
that's impossible.

526
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,000
It must be possible.

527
00:26:14,039 --> 00:26:15,680
But I have some conditions.

528
00:26:16,079 --> 00:26:16,839
I'll agree to all of them.

529
00:26:16,839 --> 00:26:17,519
Let's go now.

530
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:19,119
Hey.

531
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:37,599
They are all men,

532
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:39,119
most of them are skilled.

533
00:26:39,119 --> 00:26:41,200
It seems that I have to overcome them by softness.

534
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:43,880
Have you remembered all the information?

535
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:44,799
Say it carefully later.

536
00:26:44,839 --> 00:26:45,400
If you let slip the information,

537
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,400
don't expect to walk out of here today.

538
00:26:46,799 --> 00:26:48,599
I'll handle this little situation.

539
00:27:03,799 --> 00:27:04,759
He, he, he...

540
00:27:05,319 --> 00:27:05,839
A Jiao.

541
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:09,799
A Jiao.

542
00:27:28,799 --> 00:27:30,319
It's delicious.

543
00:27:30,319 --> 00:27:31,400
I want it.

544
00:27:31,559 --> 00:27:32,680
You don't want it?

545
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,440
Why didn't you tell me

546
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,799
we were meeting elders today?

547
00:27:35,799 --> 00:27:37,279
I didn't prepare anything.

548
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:38,400
It's so rude.

549
00:27:40,079 --> 00:27:40,880
Sister.

550
00:27:41,319 --> 00:27:42,119
You...

551
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:44,920
Mom.

552
00:27:47,319 --> 00:27:48,119
Well,

553
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:51,880
I know grandpa likes the cakes of Huayue Tower.

554
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,319
I went there specially.

555
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,240
Grandpa likes cakes?

556
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,359
Did I say that?

557
00:27:59,759 --> 00:28:00,559
Yes.

558
00:28:01,319 --> 00:28:03,279
I remember everything about you

559
00:28:03,279 --> 00:28:04,640
and your family.

560
00:28:05,119 --> 00:28:06,039
Don't just stand there.

561
00:28:06,160 --> 00:28:07,680
Introduce me to your family.

562
00:28:10,599 --> 00:28:11,880
Take your hand off me.

563
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:14,279
Take your hand off me.

564
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,480
You big dummy.

565
00:28:16,519 --> 00:28:17,200
What are you doing?

566
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:19,359
Don't you see I'm eating candy?

567
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,000
Don't be mad.

568
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:26,480
Candy.

569
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,079
Later,

570
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,640
I'll give you more.

571
00:28:31,799 --> 00:28:32,599
Humph.

572
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:33,799
What a blockhead.

573
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:39,039
This is my husband.

574
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,039
I've never heard Jiaojiao

575
00:28:45,039 --> 00:28:46,640
mention you.

576
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:47,640
Do you have a marriage certificate?

577
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,000
And the betrothal gifts?

578
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:49,640
Tell me.

579
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,920
what are your intentions towards my sister?

580
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:56,799
Enough!

581
00:28:59,400 --> 00:29:03,279
Young Master, where are you from?

582
00:29:03,519 --> 00:29:06,759
When did you meet Jiaojiao?

583
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,319
I am Cheng Qi,

584
00:29:09,319 --> 00:29:10,680
from Ning'an.

585
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,799
I'm the only child in my family.

586
00:29:12,319 --> 00:29:14,960
My father is the county sheriff of Ning'an,

587
00:29:15,359 --> 00:29:17,039
and my mother is a kind and gentle woman.

588
00:29:17,519 --> 00:29:20,279
I met my lady by chance before.

589
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:21,759
I saw her act bravely,

590
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:23,640
and admired

591
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:24,680
her courage.

592
00:29:25,319 --> 00:29:27,000
We met again in Ning'an,

593
00:29:27,759 --> 00:29:29,319
and fell in love.

594
00:29:30,119 --> 00:29:31,599
We got married right away,

595
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:34,759
without telling our parents.

596
00:29:36,119 --> 00:29:38,720
We just couldn't help it.

597
00:29:39,319 --> 00:29:40,119
Wait,

598
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,039
you married her?

599
00:29:42,799 --> 00:29:43,640
Are you going to...

600
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:44,680
Even if I have to marry into her family,

601
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,799
I will

602
00:29:47,039 --> 00:29:49,000
always be by her side.

603
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:53,519
How is it?

604
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,519
Is that enough?

605
00:29:55,519 --> 00:29:56,759
You just say it.

606
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:57,720
You are good.

607
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,559
Gong Xi.

608
00:29:59,799 --> 00:30:00,119
Master.

609
00:30:00,119 --> 00:30:02,359
Check if dinner is ready.

610
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,880
Everyone must be hungry.

611
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:05,000
And

612
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:08,200
heat up the cake.

613
00:30:08,279 --> 00:30:09,680
Yes, Grandpa.

614
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:10,759
Fa Cai,

615
00:30:11,039 --> 00:30:13,480
prepare the room for the master.

616
00:30:13,559 --> 00:30:14,200
Yes.

617
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:17,480
Go back to your room.

618
00:30:33,519 --> 00:30:34,640
This liar

619
00:30:34,839 --> 00:30:36,039
is not bad.

620
00:30:48,079 --> 00:30:48,759
Have a seat.

621
00:30:49,039 --> 00:30:49,480
Okay.

622
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,440
Do we all eat together?

623
00:30:54,039 --> 00:30:54,880
Or what?

624
00:30:55,279 --> 00:30:56,000
Hurry up.

625
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,839
Or the boss will eat all the meat.

626
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,279
Okay.

627
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:04,599
Here, my wife.

628
00:31:08,759 --> 00:31:09,960
The boss actually

629
00:31:10,559 --> 00:31:11,839
served someone.

630
00:31:26,759 --> 00:31:28,359
We escorts are rough people.

631
00:31:28,480 --> 00:31:29,440
We have to fight for food.

632
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,480
You have to learn to take care of yourself.

633
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:33,240
Otherwise, the food will be gone in a flash.

634
00:31:33,559 --> 00:31:34,559
Uh.

635
00:31:44,599 --> 00:31:45,400
Brother

636
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:49,119
I know you have many questions now.

637
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,160
But don't worry.

638
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:52,839
Because we haven't met your parents before,

639
00:31:52,839 --> 00:31:55,519
we just followed our hearts and behaved ourselves,

640
00:31:55,519 --> 00:31:56,680
and didn't dare to go beyond the rules.

641
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,759
Come on, my dear.

642
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:04,319
You agreed to let him marry into your family,

643
00:32:04,839 --> 00:32:06,640
and you are so well-behaved.

644
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:09,519
You must be very open-minded.

645
00:32:10,799 --> 00:32:12,319
Yes.

646
00:32:12,319 --> 00:32:14,079
His father asked me to discipline him.

647
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:15,960
In this case,

648
00:32:16,039 --> 00:32:18,440
you can live in the Escort Agency.

649
00:32:20,279 --> 00:32:22,599
I'll invite your father here

650
00:32:22,599 --> 00:32:24,160
to have a good talk.

651
00:32:25,559 --> 00:32:26,519
Grandpa

652
00:32:30,039 --> 00:32:31,279
Grandpa, have more.

653
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:32,960
Brother, you too.

654
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,759
Ten of them can't beat me.

655
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:35,599
They can't bully me.

656
00:32:46,079 --> 00:32:47,240
I haven't had meat in three years.

657
00:33:06,319 --> 00:33:07,880
Investigate Cheng Qi's background.

658
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,359
Do you think he's useful?

659
00:33:11,559 --> 00:33:12,599
I'll know

660
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,160
after investigation.

661
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:17,240
Dad

662
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:20,279
Jiaojiao just left home for two days,

663
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:22,000
and she brought back a man,

664
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,359
saying she got married.

665
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:26,640
No marriage certificate, no betrothal gifts, no wedding night.

666
00:33:27,319 --> 00:33:29,319
This marriage is invalid.

667
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:31,839
However,

668
00:33:32,599 --> 00:33:34,119
since both of them

669
00:33:34,119 --> 00:33:36,400
want to be the son-in-law of our escort agency,

670
00:33:36,559 --> 00:33:39,480
and Jiaojiao has set the rules for marriage selection before.

671
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,279
Why not

672
00:33:41,279 --> 00:33:43,359
let them have a competition?

673
00:33:51,759 --> 00:33:53,680
You're so considerate.

674
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,799
I agree to compete with you.

675
00:33:57,519 --> 00:33:58,920
Grandpa, no way.

676
00:33:59,079 --> 00:33:59,920
It's not fair.

677
00:34:00,279 --> 00:34:01,319
How is it unfair?

678
00:34:01,559 --> 00:34:03,200
The Escort Agency doesn't support freeloaders.

679
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:04,920
That's what you said before.

680
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,519
What?

681
00:34:07,799 --> 00:34:09,840
Is it that this Young Master Cheng

682
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:11,679
is not up to the task?

683
00:34:12,639 --> 00:34:13,920
Just do as your uncle said.

684
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,639
Whoever loses,

685
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:16,800
leaves.

686
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:20,000
Are you crazy?

687
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,599
I can't even beat Zhen Dabao.

688
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:23,159
Don't worry.

689
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,840
I know what I'm doing.

690
00:34:26,079 --> 00:34:27,519
As the son-in-law of the escort agency,

691
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,360
we should fight.

692
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:31,159
Whoever wins

693
00:34:31,679 --> 00:34:33,199
can get A Jiao.

694
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:35,960
Isn't it the same as whoever pays more

695
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:37,639
gets the goods?

696
00:34:38,559 --> 00:34:40,119
If you're afraid,

697
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:41,679
just admit defeat.

698
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:44,320
Why waste your breath?

699
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:47,639
Li Shi has a point.

700
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:49,639
To marry into the escort agency,

701
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:52,119
you need to know its business.

702
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:55,119
Young Master Cheng

703
00:34:55,119 --> 00:34:56,280
also has a point.

704
00:34:57,360 --> 00:34:59,639
Being an escort isn't just about brute force

705
00:34:59,639 --> 00:35:00,280
or courage.

706
00:35:00,440 --> 00:35:01,599
Choosing a husband

707
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:02,960
to choose a husband.

708
00:35:05,039 --> 00:35:05,840
Dad.

709
00:35:06,159 --> 00:35:07,800
So you mean

710
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:10,320
we should have

711
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:12,239
both martial and civil exams?

712
00:35:12,599 --> 00:35:13,679
Tomorrow.

713
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:15,880
Show your real skills.

714
00:35:16,039 --> 00:35:18,440
Compete on the field.
